bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    gui_retained_render_session_cpu_seed_preflight_rejected_2026-11-13, 0, "GuiRetainedRenderSession.seed returns false on the cpu backend: the damaged-render executor rejects the canonical label widget composition with fresh-device-command-preflight-required (draw_ir_adv.spl:1326), so gui_content_renderer_spec.spl is 1/3. The document is the authority for diagnosis and acceptance."

